a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px;
}"}, {"category": "maintainability", "content": "`.spinner` 和 `.health-fill` 中使用了硬编码颜色值（`#e0e0e0`、渐变中的 `#d32f2f, #e65100, #fdd835, #66bb6a, #2e7d32`），而非引用已定义的 CSS 自定义属性。如果主题色调整，这些硬编码值会成为遗漏点，导致样式不一致。建议改用 `var(--border)` 等已有变量或新增对应变量。", "existing_code": ".health-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d32f2f, #e65100, #fdd835, #66bb6a, #2e7d32); transition: width 0.5s; }", "severity": "low", "suggestion_code": ".health-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--extreme-fear), #e65100, #fdd835, var(--greed), var(--extreme-greed)); transition: width 0.5s; }"}]}

